---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="What the Bourdain Archive includes and how to suggest a correction."
>
  <header class="page-intro about-intro">
    <h1 class="page-title">About</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      The Bourdain Archive is an independent guide to Anthony Bourdain's work, appearances, and
      travels. It links to the books, articles, films, broadcasts, and saved web pages where they
      can be found.
    </p>
  </header>

  <div class="prose-grid">
    <section>
      <h2>What is included</h2>
      <p>
        Books, essays, field notes, television, films, voice and acting roles, podcasts, interviews,
        talks, and Bourdain's own web writing are included. The archive also includes criticism and
        biography that adds useful reporting or analysis. Routine celebrity coverage is left out.
      </p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2>Copyright</h2>
      <p>
        The site does not copy books, articles, transcripts, or episodes. Covers and posters help
        identify a work, and links lead to publishers, broadcasters, libraries, and other legal
        sources. The site is not affiliated with Bourdain's estate.
      </p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2>How entries are grouped</h2>
      <dl class="taxonomy-list">
        <div><dt>By Bourdain</dt><dd>Authored or co-authored work.</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Featuring Bourdain</dt><dd>Hosted work, interviews, performances, and production roles.</dd></div>
        <div><dt>About Bourdain</dt><dd>Films, books, profiles, criticism, and reference works.</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2>Corrections</h2>
      <p>
        Each entry should link to a publisher, broadcaster, library, or publication. If a title,
        date, episode order, link, or image is wrong, please send the correction and the page that
        confirms it.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>

  <section class="contribute-band">
    <h2>Send a correction</h2>
    <p>
      <a class="primary-action" href="https://github.com/h0rv/bourdain-archive">Open GitHub</a>
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
